---
import MainLayout from '../../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../../components/PageHero.astro';
import CtaBand from '../../../components/CtaBand.astro';
import IconBadge from '../../../components/IconBadge.astro';
---
<MainLayout title="Men’s Recovery Housing" description="Structured recovery housing for adult men in Pittsburgh-area communities.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Men’s recovery housing" title="A structured place to keep moving forward." intro="Substance-free shared residences for adult men, with peer community and clear expectations built into daily life." image="/images/mens-community.jpg" imageAlt="Two men having a conversation in a community setting" actions />

  <section class="section overview">
    <div class="container overview-grid">
      <div class="overview-copy"><p class="eyebrow">A place to rebuild routines</p><h2>Recovery continues when the day becomes ordinary again.</h2><p class="lead">A dependable home creates space to focus on work, appointments, meetings, relationships, and the responsibilities of everyday life.</p><p>New Beginnings men’s residences serve adults committed to substance-free living and participation in a recovery-focused household. Residents live alongside peers and remain connected to independent treatment and community recovery resources.</p></div>
      <aside class="neighborhoods"><span>Neighborhood-level information</span><strong>Sheraden</strong><strong>McKees Rocks</strong><strong>Other Pittsburgh-area communities</strong><p>Exact locations are shared privately during intake.</p></aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--tint supports">
    <div class="container supports-grid">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Inside the environment</p><h2>Four foundations for shared living.</h2></div>
      <div class="support-list">
        <article><IconBadge name="users-round" /><div><h3>Peer community</h3><p>Live alongside other men who understand that recovery is practiced one day at a time.</p></div></article>
        <article><IconBadge name="clipboard-check" /><div><h3>Clear expectations</h3><p>Shared standards help protect the stability of residents and the household as a whole.</p></div></article>
        <article><IconBadge name="briefcase-business" /><div><h3>Practical responsibility</h3><p>Daily routines support continued progress toward work, education, and personal goals.</p></div></article>
        <article><IconBadge name="waypoints" /><div><h3>Outside connection</h3><p>Residents continue working with appropriate independent providers and recovery resources.</p></div></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section privacy">
    <div class="container editorial-split">
      <div class="editorial-title"><p class="eyebrow">Privacy and fit</p><h2>The right information is shared at the right time.</h2></div>
      <div class="editorial-copy"><p class="lead">A website cannot determine whether a particular residence is the right fit.</p><p>Start with a general inquiry. New Beginnings will explain the current admissions process, discuss general fit and availability, and share exact location information privately when appropriate.</p><div class="callout-rule"><strong>Keep the first message general.</strong><p>Do not send diagnoses, medication details, treatment records, criminal-history information, Social Security numbers, or other sensitive information through the website.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand title="Ask about men’s recovery housing." label="Begin with admissions" />
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .overview-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(18rem, .55fr); gap: var(--gap-columns); align-items: start; }
  .overview-copy { display: grid; gap: var(--space-5); max-width: var(--measure); }
  .neighborhoods { display: grid; padding-block: var(--space-5); border-block: 1px solid var(--slate-300); gap: var(--space-3); }
  .neighborhoods span { color: var(--teal-700); font-size: .76rem; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .neighborhoods strong { color: var(--navy-900); font-size: 1.3rem; }
  .neighborhoods p { margin-top: var(--space-3); color: var(--slate-600); font-size: .92rem; }
  .supports-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .7fr) minmax(0, 1.3fr); gap: var(--gap-columns); }
  .supports-grid > div:first-child { display: grid; align-content: start; gap: var(--space-4); }
  .support-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; border-top: 1px solid var(--slate-300); }
  .support-list article { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr); gap: var(--space-4); padding: var(--space-5); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--slate-300); }
  .support-list article:nth-child(odd) { padding-left: 0; border-right: 1px solid var(--slate-300); }
  .support-list article > div { display: grid; gap: var(--space-2); }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .overview-grid, .supports-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 620px) { .support-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .support-list article, .support-list article:nth-child(odd) { padding-inline: 0; border-right: 0; } }
</style>
